      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.37 (up from ₹0.22 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.66b (up 81% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹185.8m (up 98% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 7.0% (up from 6.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 69% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 40% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
